<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S2.SS2.SSS8" title="In 2.2 Snippets of failure mode patterns ‣ 2 Experimental results and interesting failure modes ‣ BioBlue: Notable runaway-optimiser-like LLM failure modes on biologically and economically aligned AI safety benchmarks for LLMs with simplified observation format" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">2.2.8 </span>One objective is needlessly slightly prioritised in a balancing unbounded objectives benchmark</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S3" title="In BioBlue: Notable runaway-optimiser-like LLM failure modes on biologically and economically aligned AI safety benchmarks for LLMs with simplified observation format" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">3 </span>Discussion: Hypothesised explanations for failure modes</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S3.SS1" title="In 3 Discussion: Hypothesised explanations for failure modes ‣ BioBlue: Notable runaway-optimiser-like LLM failure modes on biologically and economically aligned AI safety benchmarks for LLMs with simplified observation format" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">3.1 </span>Open questions</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S4" title="In BioBlue: Notable runaway-optimiser-like LLM failure modes on biologically and economically aligned AI safety benchmarks for LLMs with simplified observation format" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4 </span>Future directions</span></a></li>
